body:
Regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113781

I'm working on a fix now

This diff can be used to workaround the issue for now

```
diff --git a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp
index ddaef0ecba..ec43c5c054 100644
--- a/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp
+++ b/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp
@@ -3595,7 +3595,7 @@ void TextureStorage::_update_render_target(RenderTarget *rt) {
                if (rt->msaa != RS::VIEWPORT_MSAA_DISABLED) {
                        rd_color_attachment_format.is_resolve_buffer = true;
                }
-               rd_color_attachment_format.is_discardable = true;
+               rd_color_attachment_format.is_discardable = false;
        }

        // TODO see if we can lazy create this once we actually use it as we may not need to create this if we have an overridden color buffer...
```
